WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:47.666
In the final verses of the tenth chapter,

2
00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.625
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:52.166
completes His description of His divine vibhutis.

4
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:53.041
In the previous verses,

5
00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:53.791
He gave

6
00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:57.208
many examples of His vibhutis.

7
00:00:57.208 --> 00:01:00.333
Now He emphasises the unlimited nature

8
00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:01.583
of these forms.

9
00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:04.708
They are expressions of His infinite power.

10
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.333
By recognising these divine qualities,

11
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.458
a person can establish

12
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:10.791
a deep connection with Lord Krishna.

13
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:19.375
Lord Krishna gently reminds Arjun

14
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.291
that His divine manifestations

15
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:23.333
have no limit.

16
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.125
The examples He has given in this chapter

17
00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:30.500
are only a tiny glimpse of His infinite greatness.

18
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.541
They are like drops of water

19
00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:35.333
compared to the vast ocean.

20
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.125
Lord Krishna makes clear

21
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:39.541
that to count all His forms

22
00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:43.166
or describe them is impossible, because

23
00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:45.416
they are endless.

24
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:47.333
Lord Krishna tells Arjun

25
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:50.166
that He has given only a few examples.

26
00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:53.666
These examples are to explain His glory.

27
00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:57.250
But there is no end to His divine powers.

28
00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.083
What He has described

29
00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:01.958
is only a small indication.

30
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.041
It shows

31
00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:06.375
in what ways He manifests in this world.

32
00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:08.958
This description of vibhutis shows us

33
00:02:08.958 --> 00:02:11.000
that Lord Krishna's greatness

34
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.750
is not limited to any specific

35
00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.333
beauty, strength, or intellect,

36
00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:18.000
but whatever extraordinary

37
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.416
quality or event appears all around us,

38
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:25.708
it is a reflection of His vibhuti, His form.

39
00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:29.958
In the next verse, Lord Krishna
brings this understanding even closer.

40
00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:31.333
He says that whenever

41
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:34.375
you see something grand, powerful, beautiful,

42
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:35.958
or glorious,

43
00:02:35.958 --> 00:02:37.166
know that it has arisen

44
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:42.250
from just a single spark of His radiance.

45
00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.625
The brilliance of the sun,

46
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:47.583
the fragrance of a flower, the music
of the wind, the song of birds –

47
00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:49.375
in every unique beauty

48
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:51.750
there is Lord Krishna's radiance.

49
00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:52.708
All of these are only

50
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:56.791
reflections of Lord Krishna's infinite power.

51
00:02:56.791 --> 00:02:59.250
Lord Krishna's message here is simple.

52
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.833
Every extraordinary thing

53
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:03.500
in this world is connected to Him.

54
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.750
By seeing Lord Krishna in
every glorious and wonderful

55
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.916
aspect of life,

56
00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.541
we can change our perspective.

57
00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:12.333
Instead of being drawn in by these brief

58
00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:14.750
material pleasures of a short time,

59
00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.166
in connecting with Him

60
00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:18.750
we can find lasting joy.

61
00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.958
Instead of being enchanted

62
00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:23.291
by temporary sparks, Lord Krishna

63
00:03:23.291 --> 00:03:28.000
invites us to seek that eternal light

64
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.750
which He Himself is.

65
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.833
Think about this,

66
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:41.208
when you see something beautiful,

67
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:46.625
powerful, or extraordinary in this world,

68
00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:50.208
a pleasant feeling arises.

69
00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:51.708
Does it not?

70
00:03:51.708 --> 00:03:55.916
Perhaps even wonder arises –

71
00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:57.333
where did such rare

72
00:03:57.333 --> 00:04:00.666
beauty come from?

73
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:02.583
In such moments,

74
00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:06.875
always remember.

75
00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:11.541
This is the radiance of My divinity.

76
00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:13.583
Whether it is

77
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:17.708
the gentle warmth of a sunrise,

78
00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:21.708
the flowing current of a river,

79
00:04:21.708 --> 00:04:25.708
the captivating painting of an artist, or

80
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:28.416
the sweet melody of music

81
00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:32.541
struck by a singer.

82
00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:33.833
All such

83
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:38.458
joyful experiences are connected

84
00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:40.291
to Me.

85
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:44.583
Remember, when you, with this understanding,

86
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.750
see the beauty of the world,

87
00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.333
then you do not get caught

88
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:54.166
in attraction or envy, but

89
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:57.541
it helps you merge with the divine,

90
00:04:57.541 --> 00:05:01.375
to connect with it.

91
00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:04.083
Come, do one thing.

92
00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:05.833
Start seeing these wonders

93
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:09.833
as My gifts.

94
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:13.708
When you enjoy nature, see it as

95
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:15.958
My creation.

96
00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:19.916
Someone’s intelligence or skill too,

97
00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:24.083
see as a reflection of My energy.

98
00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:26.375
Doing this,

99
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:29.291
anyone's achievements

100
00:05:29.291 --> 00:05:32.666
will not make you envious.

101
00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:36.291
A colleague being rewarded

102
00:05:36.291 --> 00:05:37.958
for good performance

103
00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:41.583
will not bring a feeling of jealousy in you,

104
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:47.083
but you will appreciate with a free heart.

105
00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:51.916
And then, in anyone's achievements,

106
00:05:51.916 --> 00:05:56.541
you will see My presence.

107
00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:58.166
This perspective

108
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:02.500
changes the way you see

109
00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.250
this world.

110
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.875
Instead of getting caught in material attraction

111
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:11.250
and pointless competition,

112
00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.791
you become grateful

113
00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:16.708
and humble.

114
00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:19.083
You come to know

115
00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:22.541
that the cause of everything

116
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:23.958
is Me.

117
00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:28.708
Accepting this, in your heart

118
00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:32.166
a sea of devotion surges forth.

119
00:06:32.166 --> 00:06:36.958
You do not chase momentary pleasures,

120
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:44.000
and you connect with the source
of joy and happiness.

121
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.875
Whoever connects with Me,

122
00:06:45.875 --> 00:06:54.083
in their mind there will be
neither envy nor jealousy.

123
00:06:58.583 --> 00:07:00.791
In your home and family, there are young

124
00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:02.958
children too, are there not?

125
00:07:02.958 --> 00:07:06.083
Nephews, nieces, grandchildren.

126
00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:08.625
You must have seen how

127
00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:13.416
they become enchanted by shiny toys.

128
00:07:13.416 --> 00:07:16.750
They imitate film stars.

129
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.791
By the glitter of material things

130
00:07:19.791 --> 00:07:21.583
they get attracted,

131
00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:26.166
and to have them, they sometimes even insist.

132
00:07:26.166 --> 00:07:31.166
In your family, teach the young children

133
00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:32.375
that they

134
00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:35.125
do not stop only at the attraction

135
00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:36.333
of these material things,

136
00:07:36.333 --> 00:07:44.416
but look at the original source
that creates that attraction,

137
00:07:44.416 --> 00:07:46.250
know it,

138
00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.166
which

139
00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:49.666
is Me.

140
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:53.333
When they admire something
beautiful, powerful,

141
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:56.250
or extraordinary,

142
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.916
explain to them

143
00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:03.166
that these qualities come from Me.

144
00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:05.750
Just as moonlight always comes

145
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.625
from its source, the moon.

146
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:13.041
Understand this through a well-known example,

147
00:08:13.041 --> 00:08:16.541
in which a small child,

148
00:08:16.541 --> 00:08:19.583
when unable to easily see

149
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:21.083
the moon, is shown

150
00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:25.416
through the branches of a tree.

151
00:08:25.416 --> 00:08:28.750
Suppose, before the child,

152
00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.750
the tree and its branches are visible.

153
00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.833
Then you first show the branches.

154
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:38.750
By pointing in the right direction,

155
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.458
when they begin to look at it well,

156
00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:46.291
then you show them the moon,

157
00:08:46.291 --> 00:08:49.375
which has risen in the sky

158
00:08:49.375 --> 00:08:51.083
and is looking down,

159
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:54.875
right above these branches.

160
00:08:54.875 --> 00:08:57.958
Now the child sees the moon too

161
00:08:57.958 --> 00:09:01.583
easily.

162
00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:05.500
In this way, beginning with the simple

163
00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.583
and gradually understanding

164
00:09:07.583 --> 00:09:11.541
complex and serious subjects is right.

165
00:09:11.541 --> 00:09:14.791
In the same way, when children

166
00:09:14.791 --> 00:09:17.916
are drawn to strength, beauty, talent,

167
00:09:17.916 --> 00:09:21.333
or success,

168
00:09:21.333 --> 00:09:24.083
use those moments to connect

169
00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:27.958
their admiration to Me,

170
00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:33.625
the original source of all wonderful marvels.

171
00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:35.458
This way,

172
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:39.125
they learn to appreciate creation,

173
00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:42.333
but are not bound by it.

174
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:45.875
Instead of getting lost in temporary attractions,

175
00:09:45.875 --> 00:09:50.125
gratitude and devotion develop in them.

176
00:09:50.125 --> 00:09:53.500
They experience that every beauty

177
00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.458
and every greatness

178
00:09:56.458 --> 00:09:59.000
draws them to Me.

179
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.416
This is true education.

180
00:10:01.416 --> 00:10:04.166
This is true love.

181
00:10:08.625 --> 00:10:11.583
Notice this.

182
00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:13.375
Someone's progress

183
00:10:13.375 --> 00:10:16.625
ordinarily stirs in your mind

184
00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:20.541
a feeling of envy.

185
00:10:20.541 --> 00:10:22.916
In your professional life,

186
00:10:22.916 --> 00:10:25.750
when you see someone else

187
00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.708
achieving excellence,

188
00:10:29.708 --> 00:10:33.833
to feel envy or jealousy

189
00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:35.916
becomes natural easily.

190
00:10:35.916 --> 00:10:39.750
Whether it is their talent, their success,

191
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:44.125
or their respect in society.

192
00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:49.291
But remember, all these extraordinary qualities

193
00:10:49.291 --> 00:10:54.791
shine with the light of My divinity.

194
00:10:54.791 --> 00:10:57.958
Accept this from the heart.

195
00:10:57.958 --> 00:11:03.500
When you see someone's talent or strength,

196
00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.416
see them as connected to Me,

197
00:11:07.416 --> 00:11:09.416
knowing that

198
00:11:09.416 --> 00:11:16.375
these gifts of talent have one divine source,

199
00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:18.791
I.

200
00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:22.625
Instead of being envious of this,

201
00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:25.583
take inspiration, that just as

202
00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:29.208
I am present in their abilities,

203
00:11:29.208 --> 00:11:33.958
in the same way I am present in your life too.

204
00:11:33.958 --> 00:11:39.166
You too have My guidance, energy,

205
00:11:39.166 --> 00:11:43.250
and the opportunity to receive My blessing.

206
00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.583
You too, by making the right effort

207
00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:50.000
and holding unwavering trust in Me,

208
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:54.750
can touch the limitless heights of success too.

209
00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:59.375
Focus on your own unique strengths,

210
00:11:59.375 --> 00:12:01.333
and then see

211
00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:04.500
how, taking My support,

212
00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.041
you can grow.

213
00:12:07.041 --> 00:12:11.125
Celebrate the successes of others.

214
00:12:11.125 --> 00:12:13.708
Know that their

215
00:12:13.708 --> 00:12:15.458
gifts

216
00:12:15.458 --> 00:12:21.000
are reflections of the richness of devotion to Me.

217
00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:26.166
When you change your perspective this way,

218
00:12:26.166 --> 00:12:29.166
then envy fades away

219
00:12:29.166 --> 00:12:33.666
and gratitude takes its place.

220
00:12:33.666 --> 00:12:36.500
You begin to see the talent of others

221
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:41.250
not as competition, but as joyful

222
00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:45.000
reminders of infinite

223
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:50.166
possibilities.

224
00:12:50.166 --> 00:12:53.625
Neither envy, nor any jealousy,

225
00:12:53.625 --> 00:12:57.750
encouragement for all.
